  const DATA = deepFreeze(JSON.parse("{\"assetRecords\":[],\"cameraRecords\":[{\"height\":124000,\"id\":\"camera.overscan-16x10-v1\",\"width\":198400,\"x\":-18000,\"y\":-12000}],\"contentVersion\":\"candidate-v4\",\"cueMappings\":[{\"assetId\":null,\"cueId\":\"cue.default\",\"fallbackStyleId\":\"ancient-greece-ai-procedural\",\"frameId\":null,\"kind\":\"asset-or-fallback\"}],\"fallbackLocale\":null,\"id\":\"candidate-v4-presentation\",\"locale\":\"en\",\"packRecords\":[{\"assetIds\":[],\"criticalAssetIds\":[],\"dependencyPackIds\":[],\"fallbackStyleId\":\"ancient-greece-ai-procedural\",\"id\":\"pack.m01\",\"kind\":\"asset-pack\",\"maxDecodedBytes\":67108864,\"maxTransferBytes\":5242880,\"missionIds\":[\"m01\"],\"preloadAssetIds\":[]},{\"assetIds\":[],\"criticalAssetIds\":[],\"dependencyPackIds\":[],\"fallbackStyleId\":\"ancient-greece-ai-procedural\",\"id\":\"pack.m04\",\"kind\":\"asset-pack\",\"maxDecodedBytes\":67108864,\"maxTransferBytes\":5242880,\"missionIds\":[\"m04\"],\"preloadAssetIds\":[]},{\"assetIds\":[],\"criticalAssetIds\":[],\"dependencyPackIds\":[],\"fallbackStyleId\":\"ancient-greece-ai-procedural\",\"id\":\"pack.m05\",\"kind\":\"asset-pack\",\"maxDecodedBytes\":67108864,\"maxTransferBytes\":5242880,\"missionIds\":[\"m05\"],\"preloadAssetIds\":[]}],\"placementRecords\":[],\"provenanceRecords\":[{\"id\":\"provenance.candidate-v4-placeholder\",\"kind\":\"authored\",\"parentIds\":[],\"reviewState\":\"concept\",\"sourceRef\":\"docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-29-armara-aegis-divine-protocols-and-unlocks.md section 14\"}],\"schemaVersion\":2,\"strings\":[{\"key\":\"act.1.era\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"The plain of Marathon, 490 BC\"},{\"key\":\"act.1.premise\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"This act restores that defense. Hold one road, learn what a line costs, and finish standing.\"},{\"key\":\"act.1.story\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Darius of Persia sent a fleet west to punish Athens for backing the Ionian revolt. It beached at Marathon, one day's march from the city. Athens went out with Plataea beside her and no Spartan column in sight, because Sparta was keeping a religious festival and would arrive after the fighting ended. Miltiades thinned his centre, weighted both wings, let the Persian middle push forward, and closed on it from either side. Herodotus counted 192 Athenian dead. The same men then walked forty kilometres home in armour to meet the fleet before it could reach an undefended city.\"},{\"key\":\"act.1.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Attican Boot Sequence\"},{\"key\":\"act.2.era\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"The Delian League, founded 478 BC\"},{\"key\":\"act.2.premise\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"This act restores the alliance. Many islands, many roads, and the slow discovery that protection and control wear the same face.\"},{\"key\":\"act.2.story\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"With Persia thrown back, the island states swore a common alliance and put its treasury on Delos, the birthplace of Apollo, where by sacred law no one was allowed to be born or to die. Members paid in ships or in silver. It held until Naxos tried to leave: the alliance besieged it, took its walls and its fleet, and Thucydides marked that as the first ally reduced to a subject, against everything the league had sworn. The treasury moved to Athens in 454 BC.\"},{\"key\":\"act.2.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Shards of the Aegean\"},{\"key\":\"act.3.era\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"The Hot Gates and Delphi, 480 BC\"},{\"key\":\"act.3.premise\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"This act restores the narrow ground and the ambiguous answer. Fewer places to stand, and a prophecy worth only as much as your reading of it.\"},{\"key\":\"act.3.story\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Xerxes returned with an army the Greeks could not meet in open country, so they chose ground where numbers could not spread out. Thermopylae was a coastal pass only a few paces wide, and Leonidas held it for two days. On the third a local man named Ephialtes showed the Persians a mountain track around it. Leonidas sent most of the army away and stayed with his Spartans, the Thespians who refused to leave, and the Thebans. At the same time Delphi told Athens to trust a wooden wall. The priests meant the palisade on the Acropolis. Themistocles argued it meant the fleet, and the fleet won at Salamis.\"},{\"key\":\"act.3.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Oracle War\"},{\"key\":\"act.4.era\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"The Peloponnesian War, 431 to 404 BC\"},{\"key\":\"act.4.premise\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"This act restores the last defense, the one fought against something the network built itself.\"},{\"key\":\"act.4.story\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"The alliance that saved Greece from Persia turned on itself. Athens and Sparta fought for twenty-seven years. Plague took perhaps a third of the city from behind its own walls, and Pericles with it. The fleet that had won at Salamis was thrown away in Sicily. Athens surrendered in 404 BC and the long walls came down to the sound of flutes. No foreign power ended the golden age. It was ended from the inside, by people certain they were defending it.\"},{\"key\":\"act.4.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Titan Singularity\"},{\"key\":\"boss.talos-prototype.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"A towering bronze automaton that releases Scout pods at fixed health thresholds. Each release briefly exposes its core to amplified damage.\"},{\"key\":\"boss.talos-prototype.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Talos Prototype\"},{\"key\":\"defense.apollo.l1.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"250 ms beam pulses ramp from 4 to 14 damage with 50 percent extra shield damage.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.apollo.l2.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Pulses ramp from 4 to 16 and reach peak faster, keeping 50 percent extra shield damage.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.apollo.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Apollo Prism\"},{\"key\":\"defense.apollo.role\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Sustained beam pressure that punishes shields.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.apollo.weakness\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Loses its ramp whenever the target changes.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.artemis.l1.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"52 damage every 2 seconds at range 38, ignoring armor.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.artemis.l2.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"80 damage every 1.9 seconds at range 42, piercing one aligned target for 50 percent.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.artemis.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Artemis Rail\"},{\"key\":\"defense.artemis.role\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Long-range armor-piercing single-target rail.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.artemis.weakness\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Slow cadence leaves gaps against swarms.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.athena.l1.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Links at most three eligible attackers and grants 10 percent range.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.athena.l2.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Links at most four attackers and grants 10 percent range and rate.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.athena.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Athena Nexus\"},{\"key\":\"defense.athena.role\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Support nexus that links nearby attackers.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.athena.weakness\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Deals no damage of its own.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.chronos.l1.description\",\"placeholders\":[{\"name\":\"damage\",\"type\":\"integer\"},{\"name\":\"cooldownMs\",\"type\":\"integer\"},{\"name\":\"slowPercent\",\"type\":\"integer\"},{\"name\":\"durationMs\",\"type\":\"integer\"}],\"value\":\"Deals {damage} damage every {cooldownMs} ms and slows targets by {slowPercent}% for {durationMs} ms.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.chronos.l2.description\",\"placeholders\":[{\"name\":\"damage\",\"type\":\"integer\"},{\"name\":\"cooldownMs\",\"type\":\"integer\"},{\"name\":\"slowPercent\",\"type\":\"integer\"},{\"name\":\"durationMs\",\"type\":\"integer\"}],\"value\":\"Deals {damage} damage every {cooldownMs} ms and slows targets by {slowPercent}% for {durationMs} ms.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.chronos.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Chronos\"},{\"key\":\"defense.chronos.role\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Controls ground and air lanes with persistent soft slows.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.chronos.weakness\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Low direct damage, and heavy enemies resist part of its control.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.hades.l1.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"14 damage every 1.25 seconds; executes non-bosses below 10 percent and its kills cannot revive.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.hades.l2.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"20 damage every 1.2 seconds with a 14 percent execute threshold.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.hades.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Hades Gate\"},{\"key\":\"defense.hades.role\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Execution gate that finishes wounded lanes.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.hades.weakness\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Ground only, and never executes a boss.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.hephaestus.l1.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"One active mine dealing 30 blast plus 4 per second for 3 seconds, replenishing in 5.5 seconds.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.hephaestus.l2.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Two mines dealing 44 blast plus 5 per second for 3.5 seconds, replenishing in 5 seconds.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.hephaestus.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Hephaestus Forge\"},{\"key\":\"defense.hephaestus.role\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Placed mines that burn a contested approach.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.hephaestus.weakness\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Ground only and limited by mine replenishment.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.hermes.l1.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"One drone dealing 8 damage every 450 ms with air priority.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.hermes.l2.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Two independent drones dealing 7 damage each every 450 ms.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.hermes.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Hermes Wing\"},{\"key\":\"defense.hermes.role\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Patrolling drones with air priority.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.hermes.weakness\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Fragile drone uptime against heavy pressure.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.hoplite.l1.description\",\"placeholders\":[{\"name\":\"slotCount\",\"type\":\"integer\"},{\"name\":\"controlDurationMs\",\"type\":\"integer\"},{\"name\":\"replenishMs\",\"type\":\"integer\"}],\"value\":\"Projects {slotCount} guard that blocks for {controlDurationMs} ms and replenishes after {replenishMs} ms.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.hoplite.l2.description\",\"placeholders\":[{\"name\":\"slotCount\",\"type\":\"integer\"},{\"name\":\"controlDurationMs\",\"type\":\"integer\"},{\"name\":\"replenishMs\",\"type\":\"integer\"}],\"value\":\"Projects {slotCount} guards that each block for {controlDurationMs} ms and replenish after {replenishMs} ms.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.hoplite.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Hoplite Node\"},{\"key\":\"defense.hoplite.role\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Creates fixed guards that hold ground threats at strategic road positions.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.hoplite.weakness\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Deals little damage, cannot affect air, and guards need time to replenish.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.medusa.l1.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"8 damage every 650 ms; every sixth shot petrifies its primary for 0.75 seconds.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.medusa.l2.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"12 damage every 600 ms; every fifth shot petrifies for 0.9 seconds.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.medusa.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Medusa Lens\"},{\"key\":\"defense.medusa.role\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Counted petrification that stalls a ground lane.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.medusa.weakness\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Hard control is rejected during Resolve.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.oracle.l1.description\",\"placeholders\":[{\"name\":\"markCount\",\"type\":\"integer\"},{\"name\":\"amplificationPercent\",\"type\":\"integer\"},{\"name\":\"range\",\"type\":\"integer\"}],\"value\":\"Reveals hidden enemies and maintains {markCount} mark that amplifies damage by {amplificationPercent}% within range {range}.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.oracle.l2.description\",\"placeholders\":[{\"name\":\"markCount\",\"type\":\"integer\"},{\"name\":\"amplificationPercent\",\"type\":\"integer\"},{\"name\":\"range\",\"type\":\"integer\"}],\"value\":\"Reveals hidden enemies and maintains {markCount} marks that amplify damage by {amplificationPercent}% within range {range}.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.oracle.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Oracle Relay\"},{\"key\":\"defense.oracle.role\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Reveals cloaked enemies and amplifies allied damage against marked targets.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.oracle.weakness\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Provides almost no direct damage and depends on nearby attackers.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.poseidon.l1.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"16 line damage every 1.25 seconds to at most three targets with 1.5 push and a 10 percent drench.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.poseidon.l2.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"24 damage every 1.15 seconds to at most four targets with 2 push and a 12 percent drench.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.poseidon.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Poseidon Coil\"},{\"key\":\"defense.poseidon.role\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Line control with knockback and drench.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.poseidon.weakness\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Ground only, with a per-target displacement cooldown.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.sentinel.l1.description\",\"placeholders\":[{\"name\":\"damage\",\"type\":\"integer\"},{\"name\":\"cooldownMs\",\"type\":\"integer\"},{\"name\":\"range\",\"type\":\"integer\"}],\"value\":\"Fires a {damage}-damage bolt every {cooldownMs} ms at ground or air targets within range {range}.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.sentinel.l2.description\",\"placeholders\":[{\"name\":\"damage\",\"type\":\"integer\"},{\"name\":\"cooldownMs\",\"type\":\"integer\"},{\"name\":\"range\",\"type\":\"integer\"}],\"value\":\"Fires a {damage}-damage bolt every {cooldownMs} ms at targets within range {range}.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.sentinel.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Sentinel\"},{\"key\":\"defense.sentinel.role\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Fast, focused fire that answers both ground and air threats.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.sentinel.weakness\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Armor and dense crowds reduce the value of its single-target attacks.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.siege.l1.description\",\"placeholders\":[{\"name\":\"damage\",\"type\":\"integer\"},{\"name\":\"cooldownMs\",\"type\":\"integer\"},{\"name\":\"radius\",\"type\":\"string\"}],\"value\":\"Launches a {damage}-damage ground shell every {cooldownMs} ms with a {radius}-unit blast radius.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.siege.l2.description\",\"placeholders\":[{\"name\":\"damage\",\"type\":\"integer\"},{\"name\":\"cooldownMs\",\"type\":\"integer\"},{\"name\":\"radius\",\"type\":\"string\"}],\"value\":\"Launches a {damage}-damage shell every {cooldownMs} ms with a {radius}-unit blast radius.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.siege.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Siege\"},{\"key\":\"defense.siege.role\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Heavy circular splash punishes tightly packed ground formations.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.siege.weakness\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Slow cadence, high cost, and no ability to attack air.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.talos.l1.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"68 damage every 2.3 seconds at range 24, ignoring 50 percent armor and applying minus 2 armor.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.talos.l2.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"100 damage every 2.2 seconds at range 25 with minus 3 armor for 3 seconds.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.talos.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Talos Bastion\"},{\"key\":\"defense.talos.role\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Heavy armor-breaking siege bastion.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.talos.weakness\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Very slow cadence against fast lanes.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.zeus.l1.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"18 damage every second to three targets at 100, 70, and 50 percent.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.zeus.l2.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"24 damage every 950 ms to five targets at 100, 75, 55, 40, and 30 percent.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.zeus.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Zeus Array\"},{\"key\":\"defense.zeus.role\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Multi-target storm arcs with falloff.\"},{\"key\":\"defense.zeus.weakness\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Falloff makes late chain targets weak.\"},{\"key\":\"enemy.echo.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"A cloaked infiltrator that becomes exposed when damaged. Oracle Relays reveal it continuously.\"},{\"key\":\"enemy.echo.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Echo\"},{\"key\":\"enemy.guardian.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"A slow armored escort built to absorb focused fire and screen lighter attackers.\"},{\"key\":\"enemy.guardian.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Guardian\"},{\"key\":\"enemy.raider.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"A sturdy rank-and-file attacker that anchors the enemy formation.\"},{\"key\":\"enemy.raider.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Raider\"},{\"key\":\"enemy.scout.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"A fragile runner whose speed punishes late coverage and slow reactions.\"},{\"key\":\"enemy.scout.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Scout\"},{\"key\":\"enemy.titan.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"A heavily armored elite with high health and partial resistance to control.\"},{\"key\":\"enemy.titan.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Titan\"},{\"key\":\"m01.briefing.mechanic.tutorial\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Command guidance pauses the battle while it introduces Aether, pads, tower comparison, construction, waves, and upgrades.\"},{\"key\":\"m01.briefing.objective\",\"placeholders\":[{\"name\":\"waveCount\",\"type\":\"integer\"}],\"value\":\"Hold the Eternal Gate through {waveCount} waves and learn when to build, upgrade, or save.\"},{\"key\":\"m01.briefing.route.main\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"One broad road bends past ten deliberate firing positions before reaching the gate.\"},{\"key\":\"m01.briefing.summary\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"The first hostile column advances at dawn. Establish a compact defense before its faster ranks arrive.\"},{\"key\":\"m01.objective.integrity.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Finish with the required gate integrity for your chosen difficulty.\"},{\"key\":\"m01.objective.integrity.progress\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Gate integrity remaining\"},{\"key\":\"m01.objective.integrity.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Unbroken Seal\"},{\"key\":\"m01.objective.mastery.description\",\"placeholders\":[{\"name\":\"maximumTowers\",\"type\":\"integer\"}],\"value\":\"Win while owning no more than {maximumTowers} towers.\"},{\"key\":\"m01.objective.mastery.progress\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Towers owned at victory\"},{\"key\":\"m01.objective.mastery.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Measured Defense\"},{\"key\":\"m01.objective.victory.description\",\"placeholders\":[{\"name\":\"waveCount\",\"type\":\"integer\"}],\"value\":\"Defeat every enemy in all {waveCount} waves.\"},{\"key\":\"m01.objective.victory.progress\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Waves cleared\"},{\"key\":\"m01.objective.victory.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Hold the Gate\"},{\"key\":\"m01.preview.tutorial-foundation\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Command guidance teaches the complete build-and-wave loop before the opening assault can threaten the gate.\"},{\"key\":\"m01.story\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"The first ships beach at first light. Nothing about this road is complicated, which is the only reason you will survive learning it.\"},{\"key\":\"m01.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Gate of Dawn\"},{\"key\":\"m01.wave.01.note\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Scouts only. Fast, fragile, and worth one point of the gate each.\"},{\"key\":\"m01.wave.01.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"First Footsteps\"},{\"key\":\"m01.wave.02.note\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Raiders join them. Heavier bodies that walk straight through thin coverage.\"},{\"key\":\"m01.wave.02.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Running Bronze\"},{\"key\":\"m01.wave.03.note\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"The column splits its timing so a single tower cannot meet all of it.\"},{\"key\":\"m01.wave.03.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Split Cadence\"},{\"key\":\"m01.wave.04.note\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Sustained pressure. This is the wave that finds an under-built road.\"},{\"key\":\"m01.wave.04.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Pressure Line\"},{\"key\":\"m01.wave.05.note\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"A long advance. Coverage matters more than any single strong position.\"},{\"key\":\"m01.wave.05.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"The Long Advance\"},{\"key\":\"m01.wave.06.note\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"The full dawn assault, every type at once.\"},{\"key\":\"m01.wave.06.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Dawn Assault\"},{\"key\":\"m04.briefing.mechanic.merge\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"North and south formations arrive together, then merge onto one final causeway. Pads marked Support trade direct road exposure for strong Oracle Relay coverage.\"},{\"key\":\"m04.briefing.objective\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Balance both entrances without neglecting the shared trunk to the gate.\"},{\"key\":\"m04.briefing.route.north\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"The north harbor approach gives dedicated coverage before joining the shared causeway.\"},{\"key\":\"m04.briefing.route.south\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"The south harbor approach demands its own answer before both formations merge.\"},{\"key\":\"m04.briefing.summary\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Two Piraeus landing parties converge through the switchyard. A tower committed to one approach may miss the other.\"},{\"key\":\"m04.objective.integrity.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Finish with the required gate integrity for your chosen difficulty.\"},{\"key\":\"m04.objective.integrity.progress\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Gate integrity remaining\"},{\"key\":\"m04.objective.integrity.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Harbor Bulwark\"},{\"key\":\"m04.objective.mastery.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Allow no enemy from either entrance to leak through the gate.\"},{\"key\":\"m04.objective.mastery.progress\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"North and south leaks\"},{\"key\":\"m04.objective.mastery.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Seal Both Harbors\"},{\"key\":\"m04.objective.victory.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Defeat every formation from both routes.\"},{\"key\":\"m04.objective.victory.progress\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Waves cleared\"},{\"key\":\"m04.objective.victory.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Secure Piraeus\"},{\"key\":\"m04.preview.two-route-merge\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Route labels reveal simultaneous north and south deployments before each wave begins.\"},{\"key\":\"m04.story\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"The fleet turns for the harbour. Two landings, one road home, and no time to favour either.\"},{\"key\":\"m04.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Piraeus Switchyard\"},{\"key\":\"m04.wave.01.note\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Both harbours land at once. Neither entrance can be ignored.\"},{\"key\":\"m04.wave.01.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Twin Landings\"},{\"key\":\"m04.wave.02.note\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Raiders press the north approach before the causeway merges.\"},{\"key\":\"m04.wave.02.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Harbor Raiders\"},{\"key\":\"m04.wave.03.note\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Guardians escort the cargo. Heavy armour blunts fast, light weapons.\"},{\"key\":\"m04.wave.03.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Armoured Cargo\"},{\"key\":\"m04.wave.04.note\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Cloaked Echoes on the quays. Only damage or a reveal exposes them.\"},{\"key\":\"m04.wave.04.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Echoes on the Quays\"},{\"key\":\"m04.wave.05.note\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Both columns converge onto the shared road.\"},{\"key\":\"m04.wave.05.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Converging Steel\"},{\"key\":\"m04.wave.06.note\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Everything the harbour has left, on both approaches at once.\"},{\"key\":\"m04.wave.06.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"The Piraeus Crush\"},{\"key\":\"m05.briefing.mechanic.talos\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Talos releases Scout pods at fixed health thresholds and exposes its core for a short damage window.\"},{\"key\":\"m05.briefing.objective\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Survive the spiral siege, preserve enough force for Talos, and strike hard when its core opens.\"},{\"key\":\"m05.briefing.route.spiral\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"The clockwise spiral offers repeated coverage, while pads marked Support are deliberate Oracle Relay positions rather than primary firing sites.\"},{\"key\":\"m05.briefing.summary\",\"placeholders\":[{\"name\":\"waveCount\",\"type\":\"integer\"}],\"value\":\"The Bronze Warden awakens inside the foundry. {waveCount} waves coil inward before Talos takes the road.\"},{\"key\":\"m05.objective.integrity.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Finish with the required gate integrity for your chosen difficulty.\"},{\"key\":\"m05.objective.integrity.progress\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Gate integrity remaining\"},{\"key\":\"m05.objective.integrity.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Foundry Fortitude\"},{\"key\":\"m05.objective.mastery.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Prevent Talos and every enemy descended from its boss wave from leaking.\"},{\"key\":\"m05.objective.mastery.progress\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Boss-lineage leaks\"},{\"key\":\"m05.objective.mastery.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Break the Bronze Line\"},{\"key\":\"m05.objective.victory.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Destroy Talos and clear every supporting formation.\"},{\"key\":\"m05.objective.victory.progress\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Waves cleared\"},{\"key\":\"m05.objective.victory.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Topple the Warden\"},{\"key\":\"m05.preview.talos-thresholds\",\"placeholders\":[{\"name\":\"bossWave\",\"type\":\"integer\"}],\"value\":\"Talos enters on Wave {bossWave}. Its warning pulse precedes each Scout-pod release and exposed-core window.\"},{\"key\":\"m05.preview.titan-heavy\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Titans arrive next: slow Heavy enemies with extreme durability, strong armor, and a punishing gate leak.\"},{\"key\":\"m05.story\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Crete's bronze guardian was said to circle its island three times a day and let nothing come ashore. Something like it is awake in the foundry, and nobody told it the war ended.\"},{\"key\":\"m05.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Bronze Warden\"},{\"key\":\"m05.wave.01.note\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Runners test the spiral. The road passes your positions more than once here.\"},{\"key\":\"m05.wave.01.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Foundry Runners\"},{\"key\":\"m05.wave.02.note\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Bronze escorts. Armour starts to matter.\"},{\"key\":\"m05.wave.02.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Bronze Escort\"},{\"key\":\"m05.wave.03.note\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Hidden sparks. Cloaked units mixed into an ordinary column.\"},{\"key\":\"m05.wave.03.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Hidden Sparks\"},{\"key\":\"m05.wave.04.note\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Armoured Guardians and cloaked Echoes share the same road.\"},{\"key\":\"m05.wave.04.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Armour and Echo\"},{\"key\":\"m05.wave.05.note\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Heavy footfalls. Slow, durable, and hard to displace.\"},{\"key\":\"m05.wave.05.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Heavy Footfalls\"},{\"key\":\"m05.wave.06.note\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"The coils tighten. Sustained pressure before the Warden wakes.\"},{\"key\":\"m05.wave.06.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Coils of War\"},{\"key\":\"m05.wave.07.note\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"The last wave before Talos. Preserve what you will need.\"},{\"key\":\"m05.wave.07.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Before the Warden\"},{\"key\":\"m05.wave.08.note\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Talos Unbound. It sheds Scout pods at fixed health thresholds and exposes its core after each one.\"},{\"key\":\"m05.wave.08.title\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Talos Unbound\"},{\"key\":\"mechanism.athena-statue-beam.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Athena Statue Beam\"},{\"key\":\"mechanism.bridgefall.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Bridgefall\"},{\"key\":\"mechanism.bronze-city-gate.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Bronze City Gate\"},{\"key\":\"mechanism.harbor-chain.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Harbor Chain\"},{\"key\":\"mechanism.sacred-braziers.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Sacred Braziers\"},{\"key\":\"protocol.aegis-ward.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Divine Protocol Aegis Ward\"},{\"key\":\"protocol.armara-ascension.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Divine Protocol Armara Ascension\"},{\"key\":\"protocol.athena-command.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Divine Protocol Athena Command\"},{\"key\":\"protocol.hades-bargain.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Divine Protocol Hades Bargain\"},{\"key\":\"protocol.hephaestus-overclock.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Divine Protocol Hephaestus Overclock\"},{\"key\":\"protocol.hermes-rewind.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Divine Protocol Hermes Rewind\"},{\"key\":\"protocol.medusa-lock.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Divine Protocol Medusa Lock\"},{\"key\":\"protocol.poseidon-surge.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Divine Protocol Poseidon Surge\"},{\"key\":\"protocol.temporal-edict.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Divine Protocol Temporal Edict\"},{\"key\":\"protocol.zeus-skyfire.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Divine Protocol Zeus Skyfire\"},{\"key\":\"recon.0.detail\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"You can see every route, enemy type, and boss rule for this mission, but not how many are coming. Recon reveals exact numbers.\"},{\"key\":\"recon.1.detail\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Recon I shows exact numbers and routes for the next wave.\"},{\"key\":\"recon.2.detail\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Recon II shows exact numbers for the next two waves, and roughly when each group arrives.\"},{\"key\":\"recon.3.detail\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Recon III shows exact numbers, routes, and arrival times for every wave left in the mission.\"},{\"key\":\"reinforcement.artemis-scout.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Artemis Scout\"},{\"key\":\"reinforcement.spartan-phalanx.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Spartan Phalanx\"},{\"key\":\"reinforcement.talos-automaton.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Talos Automaton\"},{\"key\":\"relic.broken-aegis.benefit\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Broken Aegis grants its recorded benefit before the run begins.\"},{\"key\":\"relic.broken-aegis.drawback\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Broken Aegis charges its recorded drawback for that benefit.\"},{\"key\":\"relic.broken-aegis.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Broken Aegis\"},{\"key\":\"relic.bronze-obol.benefit\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Bronze Obol grants its recorded benefit before the run begins.\"},{\"key\":\"relic.bronze-obol.drawback\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Bronze Obol charges its recorded drawback for that benefit.\"},{\"key\":\"relic.bronze-obol.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Bronze Obol\"},{\"key\":\"relic.forge-ember.benefit\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Forge Ember grants its recorded benefit before the run begins.\"},{\"key\":\"relic.forge-ember.drawback\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Forge Ember charges its recorded drawback for that benefit.\"},{\"key\":\"relic.forge-ember.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Forge Ember\"},{\"key\":\"relic.hermes-greaves.benefit\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Hermes Greaves grants its recorded benefit before the run begins.\"},{\"key\":\"relic.hermes-greaves.drawback\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Hermes Greaves charges its recorded drawback for that benefit.\"},{\"key\":\"relic.hermes-greaves.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Hermes Greaves\"},{\"key\":\"relic.laurel-of-ares.benefit\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Laurel Of Ares grants its recorded benefit before the run begins.\"},{\"key\":\"relic.laurel-of-ares.drawback\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Laurel Of Ares charges its recorded drawback for that benefit.\"},{\"key\":\"relic.laurel-of-ares.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Laurel Of Ares\"},{\"key\":\"relic.owl-lens.benefit\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Owl Lens grants its recorded benefit before the run begins.\"},{\"key\":\"relic.owl-lens.drawback\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Owl Lens charges its recorded drawback for that benefit.\"},{\"key\":\"relic.owl-lens.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Owl Lens\"},{\"key\":\"relic.tideglass.benefit\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Tideglass grants its recorded benefit before the run begins.\"},{\"key\":\"relic.tideglass.drawback\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Tideglass charges its recorded drawback for that benefit.\"},{\"key\":\"relic.tideglass.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Tideglass\"},{\"key\":\"relic.titan-gear.benefit\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Titan Gear grants its recorded benefit before the run begins.\"},{\"key\":\"relic.titan-gear.drawback\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Titan Gear charges its recorded drawback for that benefit.\"},{\"key\":\"relic.titan-gear.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Titan Gear\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.apollo-forked-ray.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Pulses ramp 4 to 18 with 50 percent extra shield damage and fork at 45 percent, or 70 percent against a shielded second target.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.apollo-forked-ray.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Forked Ray\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.apollo-solar-lance.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Pulses ramp 4 to 24 and reach peak faster with double shield damage, and it never forks.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.apollo-solar-lance.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Solar Lance\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.artemis-execution-line.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"118 damage every 1.8 seconds at range 46; every fourth primary deals 150 percent and the 50 percent pierce never crits.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.artemis-execution-line.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Execution Line\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.artemis-threader.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"96 damage every 1.65 seconds at range 44 through up to three aligned targets at 100, 65, and 40 percent, with no crit.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.artemis-threader.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Threader\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.athena-command-mesh.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Links five attackers for 12 percent range and 15 percent rate, with no coordinated-damage bonus.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.athena-command-mesh.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Command Mesh\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.athena-coordinated-fire.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Links four attackers for 10 percent range and rate and adds 8 percent damage when two links share a target.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.athena-coordinated-fire.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Coordinated Fire\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.chronos-echo-field.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"6 damage every 720 ms with a 48 percent slow for 1.5 seconds; every fifth attack echoes a weaker slow to at most two nearby enemies.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.chronos-echo-field.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Echo Field\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.chronos-time-debt.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"5 damage every 760 ms with a 55 percent slow for 1.8 seconds; a third consecutive hit consumes its own slow stacks for 18 temporal damage.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.chronos-time-debt.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Time Debt\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.hades-soul-tithe.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"30 damage every 1.0 second with a 20 percent execute; the first six executes each wave grant 2 Aether and there is no banish.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.hades-soul-tithe.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Soul Tithe\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.hades-twin-banish.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"28 damage every 1.1 seconds with an 18 percent execute; every third execute may banish one nearby wounded non-boss on an 8 second cooldown.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.hades-twin-banish.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Twin Banish\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.hephaestus-molten-field.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Two mines dealing 60 blast plus 6 per second for 4 seconds, replenishing in 4.5 seconds and leaving a 2.5 second anti-regeneration field.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.hephaestus-molten-field.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Molten Field\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.hephaestus-triple-foundry.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Three mines dealing 46 blast plus 5 per second for 3.5 seconds, replenishing in 3.8 seconds, with no persistent field.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.hephaestus-triple-foundry.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Triple Foundry\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.hermes-sky-swarm.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Three drones dealing 7 damage every 450 ms with air priority and an internal air coefficient, and no bonus-shot counter.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.hermes-sky-swarm.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Sky Swarm\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.hermes-wing-command.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Two drones dealing 8 damage every 400 ms; every sixth drone attack fires one bonus shot.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.hermes-wing-command.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Wing Command\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.hoplite-phalanx.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Three guards with a 1.2 second block and 5 second replenish; the first eligible contact bashes for 12.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.hoplite-phalanx.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Phalanx\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.hoplite-spearwall.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Two guards with a 1.0 second block and 4.25 second replenish; every accepted contact deals 24 and there is no opening bash.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.hoplite-spearwall.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Spearwall\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.medusa-basilisk-focus.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"19 damage every 600 ms; every fourth shot petrifies only the primary target for 1.5 seconds.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.medusa-basilisk-focus.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Basilisk Focus\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.medusa-gorgon-bloom.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"16 damage every 550 ms; every fifth shot petrifies the primary for 1 second and radius 2.5 secondaries for 0.35 seconds.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.medusa-gorgon-bloom.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Gorgon Bloom\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.oracle-chorus.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Two 11 percent marks at range 32; every fifth scan marks at most five targets for 2 seconds.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.oracle-chorus.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Chorus\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.oracle-judgment.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Three simultaneous 15 percent marks at range 30, with no mass-scan capstone.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.oracle-judgment.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Judgment\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.poseidon-maelstrom.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"30 damage every 1.05 seconds to five targets with 2.5 push and a 15 percent drench; every fifth attack is a 40 damage six-target maelstrom.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.poseidon-maelstrom.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Maelstrom\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.poseidon-undertow.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"24 damage every 1.1 seconds to four targets with 3.5 push and a 25 percent drench, and no maelstrom counter.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.poseidon-undertow.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Undertow\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.sentinel-lock-on.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"18 damage every 360 ms at range 26; three consecutive primary hits add 15 percent internal damage until the target changes.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.sentinel-lock-on.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Lock-On\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.sentinel-twin-lance.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"15 damage every 340 ms at range 25; the closest second target within 6 units takes 60 percent and never advances a counter.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.sentinel-twin-lance.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Twin Lance\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.siege-breach-core.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"52 damage every 1.2 seconds at range 28 with radius 6.5; the central 2.5 units take 35 percent extra.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.siege-breach-core.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Breach Core\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.siege-sun-shrapnel.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"42 damage every 1.05 seconds at range 28 with radius 8 across at most eight targets, and no center bonus.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.siege-sun-shrapnel.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Sun Shrapnel\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.talos-earthbreaker.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"105 damage every 1.8 seconds at range 25 in radius 4 with 35 percent armor ignore and minus 3 armor for 3 seconds.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.talos-earthbreaker.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Earthbreaker\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.talos-titan-hunter.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"145 damage every 2 seconds at range 26 with 50 percent armor ignore, minus 4 armor for 3 seconds, and 30 percent extra boss damage.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.talos-titan-hunter.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Titan Hunter\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.zeus-storm-crown.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"30 damage every 900 ms to five targets at 100 to 30 percent; every sixth attack adds up to three 30 percent storm targets.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.zeus-storm-crown.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Storm Crown\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.zeus-thunderhead.description\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"38 damage every 1.05 seconds to three targets; every eighth primary creates a 70 damage radius 3 burst that cannot recurse.\"},{\"key\":\"specialization.zeus-thunderhead.name\",\"placeholders\":[],\"value\":\"Thunderhead\"}]}"));
